{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "streaming/what-a-target-s-outputs-leave-in-the-room",
  "title": "Of what a transport returns for a streamed row, the room keeps on_event()'s tasks, observations and metadata updates, deliver()'s metadata updates alone, and nothing of a streaming target's deliver_stream(): ON_TASK_CREATED fires for on_event()'s task only, with the row",
  "rules": [
    "§6.1",
    "§12.2 step 13s",
    "§10.1 step 15"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: core/event_router.py _merged keeps each target's on_event() tasks and observations and both outputs' metadata updates, deliver()'s tasks and observations dropped; core/mixins/inbound_streaming.py _deliver_segments awaits deliver_stream() and keeps none of its ChannelOutput, only what it raises; the row the stream commits reaches web through the room's lane, whose delivery set's side effects are kept with the row (lane_execution.py _post_plan_effects). ws streams the row and is not delivered it again.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "web",
        "type": "webhook",
        "category": "transport",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "output": {
              "tasks": [
                {
                  "title": "Told"
                }
              ],
              "observations": [
                {
                  "category": "told",
                  "content": "on_event"
                }
              ],
              "metadata_updates": {
                "told": true
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "deliver": [
          {
            "output": {
              "tasks": [
                {
                  "title": "Delivered"
                }
              ],
              "observations": [
                {
                  "category": "delivered",
                  "content": "deliver"
                }
              ],
              "metadata_updates": {
                "delivered": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ws",
        "type": "websocket",
        "category": "transport",
        "streams": true,
        "deliver_stream": [
          {
            "output": {
              "tasks": [
                {
                  "title": "Streamed"
                }
              ],
              "observations": [
                {
                  "category": "streamed",
                  "content": "deliver_stream"
                }
              ],
              "metadata_updates": {
                "streamed": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "agent",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "deltas": [
                "All ",
                "done."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "web"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "ws"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "agent",
            "category": "intelligence"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "hooks": [
      {
        "name": "tasks",
        "trigger": "on_task_created",
        "execution": "async"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "web",
        "sender_id": "alice",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Done yet?"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "streamed": {
      "room-1": {
        "ws": [
          {
            "text": "All "
          },
          {
            "text": "done."
          },
          {
            "row": {
              "id": "room-1#1",
              "content": {
                "body": "All done."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "deliveries": {
      "room-1": {
        "web": [
          {
            "id": "room-1#1",
            "content": {
              "body": "All done."
            }
          }
        ],
        "ws": [
          {
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "tasks": {
      "room-1": [
        {
          "title": "Told"
        }
      ]
    },
    "observations": {
      "room-1": [
        {
          "category": "told",
          "content": "on_event"
        }
      ]
    },
    "rooms": {
      "room-1": {
        "metadata": {
          "told": true,
          "delivered": true,
          "streamed": {
            "$absent": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hooks": {
      "tasks": [
        {
          "trigger": "on_task_created",
          "room_id": "room-1",
          "event": {
            "type": "task_created",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "agent"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "All done."
            },
            "metadata": {
              "task_title": "Told"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
